### 收货地址接口使用的登录凭证
# @name addressLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"admin","password":"12345678"}

###

### 新增收货地址（用户的第一个地址会自动成为默认地址）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{addressLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient": "张三",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "province": "江苏省",
  "city": "南京市",
  "district": "玄武区",
  "detail": "中山路 100 号 1 栋 101 室"
}

###

### 第二个地址不会自动变默认（is_default 提交也会被忽略）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{addressLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient": "李四",
  "phone": "13900139000",
  "province": "江苏省",
  "city": "苏州市",
  "district": "姑苏区",
  "detail": "平江路 200 号 2 栋 202 室",
  "is_default": true
}

###

### 非法手机号应返回 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{addressLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient": "王五",
  "phone": "12345",
  "province": "江苏省",
  "city": "无锡市",
  "district": "梁溪区",
  "detail": "解放西路 300 号 3 栋 303 室"
}

###
